"Component: Impulse": {
  "index": "2",
  "category": "sorcery",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Impulse"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "I can use my magic to cause an item from my other hand to "
        },
        {
          "text": "launch forward becoming an improvised projectile",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nCertain items are naturally projectiles, gaining a damage bonus.  If I enchant the item with the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Telekinetic Retrieval",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " enchantment, it will "
        },
        {
          "text": "automatically return to my inventory after impact",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". If I target myself with this spell, I will launch the item in the direction I am facing.  If I target something else, I will launch the item at that target regardless of where I am facing. I bet if I "
        },
        {
          "text": "augment the spell by supplying gunpowder as an optional reagent",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", it will launch the projectile with much more force, and therefore much higher damage."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
    {
      "type": "spell_part",
      "location": "mna:components/impulse"
    }
  ]
}